<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-11-14T19:23:12.772Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 14 Nov 2026 19:23:12 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Gunmen abducted five people and shot two in a Plateau community while bandits abducted three in Wase, Plateau and killed a 3‑year-old girl in Zamfara after a kidnapping. Troops ambushed and neutralised 14 bandits in Katsina and over 50 people were killed as vigilantes clashed with bandits in Zamfara. President Tinubu publicly sought forgiveness from victims' families in Plateau and pledged support to rebuild affected communities. AI-generated disinformation is now influencing the upcoming elections, adding an information-war element. The conflict recorded 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dw.com/en/nigeria-how-the-pcoming-elections-are-influeced-by-the-rise-of-ai-disinformation/a-79946897?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-rdf&quot;&gt;Deutsche Welle&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikwFBVV95cUxQeEZocDhmNF9JMUJJZUZJTEROelQ4bFBlR0RNX3hHR3ExeHlGYnJ3Nm1HR3lCc3FoNU0tTXJUTDM0Qi1zMTMtYU5DNEF1Q0xLZWQ3YlFNNlFlQ01naUFvbnNGZE80NXZBT01tVDh3TXFSVXc2RU4tVklaanFiTWF5a214X1c2ZExmUXBpVklRX2pxODg?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwFBVV95cUxPX0RHTTNBUy1ScjJ4ekxwUXpTclJDRGZKSGM4cVR0Rnl6Qmozby1YM213czh1X3VEeDIwVmN0d2x3cWxCMXV4N2NORTl1Q2NBMTlzYXd5SEp2MlFNbVpSQjV6RThSUFFvTXlFTGxqMzhvYnpselNGRzRyOU5BNTMydUZxckpqUnVyOVhF?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijwFBVV95cUxPRXl0bGNGR0tzcExjQnhpOEZVektucGhMOTYxSHNTelQ5dGktTmxZeV9jaHh2dGVTUF9HN2oxMndueVFyT0R4bF9uU09GMVpRUFIyM1FaMGJfZVVxTk9OM21BZG92bHktSmk1eXBzdlNUQ2tCMWZ1Z2gybmFKRnQ2V09rbEVXd0lJaTRMUk1RUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiigFBVV95cUxQV1VHZXFTVHl4QXd5RDFoME11UlpQZnN5S2duQ2JyRzBwc3RUM0VqZkpJX2